# Module 04 – AI Applications and Analysis

## Overview
This module focuses on practical applications of artificial intelligence across different domains. It explores how AI can be used to analyze data, generate insights, and support decision-making in real-world scenarios.

## Assignments Included
- In-Class Assignment: AI-Based Stock News Sentiment Tracker
- Module 04 Class Notes
- AI in Fraud Detection Case Study

## Objective
The goal of this module is to understand how AI techniques can be applied to solve real-world problems, particularly in areas like finance, data analysis, and security.

## Structure
Each assignment is organized into its own folder and includes:
- A README file explaining the assignment
- The assignment submission file

